# Git commits

Do not add co-author attribution to GitHub.

Never include `Co-authored-by` trailers in commit messages (including Cursor, Copilot, or any other agent). Do not pass `--trailer`, `Co-authored-by`, or equivalent when committing.

```
# BAD
git commit -m "$(cat <<'EOF'
Fix the match list skeleton.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
EOF
)"

# GOOD
git commit -m "$(cat <<'EOF'
Fix the match list skeleton.

EOF
)"
```
